35,2,1,talk,George,,- **George**: The other households said asking favours each time is what breaks trust. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The diary shows Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. The recording trial cost an hour weekly. That administrative burden is the real cost we are ignoring.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Twice this year I found it with the fuel light on and rubbish inside. Plus, our weekly trips keep collapsing at short notice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are over 280,000 yen. The fuel is lopsided, with two people buying most of it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found the fuel receipts are very uneven. Two people bought most of it. Also, Saturdays are used three times more than Tuesdays.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, that hour a week is a heavy price. @Misaki, knowing the fixed costs helps, but we must be careful not to turn this into an audit.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree. The audit itself becomes the problem. @Minato, the uneven fuel use confirms the diary’s imbalance.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, that hour a week is exactly the friction I want to avoid. @Minato, the uneven fuel use explains why the car feels so neglected.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I hear you. But if we ignore the lopsided fuel costs, the ""even"" split is a lie. We need to account for that reality.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I agree. It feels unfair if we just split it evenly. @Toshio, I hope we can find a way that doesn't take too much time.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"@Misaki, you are right. We must be fair, but we must not let the checking turn into accusations. We need a system that works without constant suspicion.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, agreed. The system must minimize the checking. @Minato, the diary shows the imbalance, but the recording trial shows the cost of tracking it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, that hour a week is exactly the friction I want to avoid. @Minato, the uneven fuel use explains why the car feels so neglected.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
