49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I’m sorry the car felt neglected. @Misaki, I agree. We need fairness without making everyone feel watched.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
